        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F7F7;strokeColor=#BBBBBB;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;&#xa;Dark blue = Person   ·   Grey = External system   ·   Mid blue = Container we own&#xa;Cylinder = Oracle schema, one per owning service&#xa;Dashed outline = boundary or group&#xa;&#xa;Solid line = synchronous request/response&#xa;Dashed line = asynchronous event via Kafka (Avro)&#xa;Dotted line = schema validation" vertex="1">
