        <mxCell id="assumptions" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9E6;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b&gt;Assumptions and open questions — resolve before sign-off&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;&#xa;1. fdt-web-ui and fdt-api-gateway are assumed. Replace with the real entry point if one exists.&#xa;2. Ingestion is batch pull. If near-real-time is needed, move to CDC (Debezium) or source-side publishing. What is the latency SLA?&#xa;3. Config is consumed as events into a local cache — no hard runtime dependency on fdt-configuration-svc. Confirm staleness tolerance.&#xa;4. Delete FDT_TRIP_STAGING if normalization is genuinely stateless.&#xa;5. Confirm Penske location lookup is an external call, not an internal library.&#xa;6. Not shown at L2: observability, secrets, backup/DR, environment topology.&#xa;7. Component detail from v1 belongs in L3 diagrams, one per service." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="280" width="1400" x="1380" y="1400" as="geometry" />
